{
  "id": "E389",
  "title": "Bring a Power Bank",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2019-12-22",
  "synopsis": "Why did Paul insist on bringing a power bank when hiking?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/50389/0239764089dfce1ad6c24d8f9aab7b4a38ac2d33.mp3?1576504319",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "一定要带充电宝\n\n保罗：明天爬山的东西你准备好了吗？\n小乐：都准备好了。三明治、水果、水、纸巾、垃圾袋，还有相机。\n保罗：你怎么没拿充电宝？\n小乐：我们只去半天，为什么要拿充电宝？\n保罗：我们要用手机导航、听音乐，休息的时候我还想玩游戏，万一没电了怎么办？一定要带充电宝！\n小乐：好吧，那充电宝放你包里。那么重，我可不想背着。\n",
    "traditional": "一定要帶充電寶\n\n保羅：明天爬山的東西你準備好了嗎？\n小樂：都準備好了。三明治、水果、水、紙巾、垃圾袋，還有相機。\n保羅：你怎麼沒拿充電寶？\n小樂：我們只去半天，為什麼要拿充電寶？\n保羅：我們要用手機導航、聽音樂，休息的時候我還想玩遊戲，萬一沒電了怎麼辦？一定要帶充電寶！\n小樂：好吧，那充電寶放你包裡。那麼重，我可不想背著。\n"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "It’s necessary to bring a power bank"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "保罗：明天爬山的东西你准备好了吗？",
      "traditional": "保羅：明天爬山的東西你準備好了嗎？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó míng tiān pá shān de dōng xi nǐ zhǔn bèi hǎo le ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Have you prepared everything for the hike tomorrow?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小乐：都准备好了。三明治、水果、水、纸巾、垃圾袋，还有相机。",
      "traditional": "小樂：都準備好了。三明治、水果、水、紙巾、垃圾袋，還有相機。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè dōu zhǔn bèi hǎo le sān míng zhì shuǐ guǒ shuǐ zhǐ jīn lā jī dài hái yǒu xiàng jī",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Everything is prepared. Sandwiches, fruit, water, tissues, trash bags, and a camera as well."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "保罗：你怎么没拿充电宝？",
      "traditional": "保羅：你怎麼沒拿充電寶？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó nǐ zěn me méi ná chōng diàn bǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Why don’t you take a power bank?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小乐：我们只去半天，为什么要拿充电宝？",
      "traditional": "小樂：我們只去半天，為什麼要拿充電寶？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè wǒ men zhǐ qù bàn tiān wèi shén me yào ná chōng diàn bǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: We will only be gone for half a day, why do you want to take a power bank?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "保罗：我们要用手机导航、听音乐，休息的时候我还想玩游戏，",
      "traditional": "保羅：我們要用手機導航、聽音樂，休息的時候我還想玩遊戲，",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó wǒ men yào yòng shǒu jī dǎo háng tīng yīn yuè xiū xi de shí hou wǒ hái xiǎng wán yóu xì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "万一没电了怎么办？一定要带充电宝！",
      "traditional": "萬一沒電了怎麼辦？一定要帶充電寶！",
      "pinyin": "wàn yī méi diàn le zěn me bàn yí dìng yào dài chōng diàn bǎo",
      "english": "Paul: We need to use our cellphones to navigate, listen to music, and I also want to play games when we rest."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "What if my cellphone runs out of battery? It’s necessary to bring a power bank!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "小乐：好吧，那充电宝放你包里。那么重，我可不想背着。",
      "traditional": "小樂：好吧，那充電寶放你包裡。那麼重，我可不想背著。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè hǎo ba nà chōng diàn bǎo fàng nǐ bāo lǐ nà me zhòng wǒ kě bù xiǎng bēi zhe",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Fine, then put the power bank in your bag. It is so heavy, I really don’t want to carry it."
    }
  ],
