    "sentence_translations": [
      "It’s necessary to bring a power bank",
      "",
      "Paul: Have you prepared everything for the hike tomorrow?",
      "",
      "Little Le: Everything is prepared. Sandwiches, fruit, water, tissues, trash bags, and a camera as well.",
      "",
      "Paul: Why don’t you take a power bank?",
      "",
      "Little Le: We will only be gone for half a day, why do you want to take a power bank?",
      "",
      "Paul: We need to use our cellphones to navigate, listen to music, and I also want to play games when we rest.",
      "What if my cellphone runs out of battery? It’s necessary to bring a power bank!",
      "",
      "Little Le: Fine, then put the power bank in your bag. It is so heavy, I really don’t want to carry it.",
      ""
    ]
  }
